  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Steppe clanhold, ascending. Built on khan: Khan (king) kingdom, Khagan (khan of khans) empire over the Yeke Ulus (the Great Nation). Noyan (noble) barony; Tarkhan (privileged border-lord) march; Zuun-Noyan (commander of a hundred) county; Mingghan-Noyan (commander of a thousand) duchy; Beki (great chief) principality. The khural (chiefs' assembly) raises the khan; the decimal war-host (arban/zuun/mingghan/tumen) is the realm's spine. (Rank titles are the real Mongol-Turkic register, allowed.)",
